### Render a named catalog template as JSON
POST http://127.0.0.1:9901/render?pretty=1
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "template": "invoice",
  "props": {
    "number": "A-42",
    "total": "R$ 129,90"
  }
}

### Render another catalog template as HTML
POST http://127.0.0.1:9901/render
Accept: text/html
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "template": "home",
  "props": {
    "title": "Orders"
  }
}
